      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is very important that you **do not** start taking Vitamin K supplements without first discussing it with your healthcare provider. Vitamin K directly interferes with how warfarin works to prevent clots, which could make your blood too thick or too thin. This interaction can put you at serious risk for dangerous bleeding or clots. Please call your doctor or pharmacist immediately to discuss this change in your supplement regimen.",
